  What may reach a model: pins and their versions, types and budget⟦f:intent-criteria⟧, the intent⟦/f⟧⟦f:work-rooms⟧, stakes⟦/f⟧⟦f:conversation⟧, posts⟦/f⟧⟦f:facilitator⟧, room summaries⟦/f⟧, envelopes, restore blocks⟦f:notices⟧, opt-in notices⟦/f⟧⟦f:held-requests⟧ and held requests⟦/f⟧.
